  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:10%;display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:6.667%;min-width:4.537%;text-align:justify;"><span style="transform:scale(0.67);color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:super;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman;transform-origin:top left;font-kerning:none;min-width:5.041111111111111%;visibility:hidden;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;"></span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">commencing on the first anniversary of the grant date, and 50% are subject to performance-based vesting, which vests over a four-year performance period upon achievement of specified targets. Performance-based RSUs vest cumulatively as targets are achieved, including vesting of prior-year awards if targets are first achieved in a later year, and any unearned awards are forfeited at the end of the performance period. The target payout for the performance-based RSUs is the maximum potential payment for such performance-based RSUs. For more information concerning our stock based compensation plans, refer to Note 15 of the Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements included in the 2025 Annual Report on Form 10-K filed with the SEC.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:10%;display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:6.667%;min-width:4.537%;text-align:justify;"><span style="transform:scale(0.67);color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:super;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman;transform-origin:top left;font-kerning:none;min-width:5.041111111111111%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(4)</span